<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>herdvia third-party licenses</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
        .license-text { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 12px; overflow-x: auto; }
        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            body { background: #1e1e1e; color: #ddd; }
            a { color: #8ab4f8; }
            .license-text { background: #2a2a2a; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
    <p>herdvia is built from the open source Rust crates listed below. Their licenses are reproduced on this page.</p>
    <p>The source code of every crate listed here is available from crates.io at exactly the version shown, and herdvia uses these crates without modification.</p>
    <p>The herdvia executable also contains the Rust standard library, which is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0 (<a href="https://github.com/rust-lang/rust">https://github.com/rust-lang/rust</a>).</p>

    <h2>Overview</h2>
    <ul>
        {{#each overview}}
        <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
        {{/each}}
    </ul>

    <h2>License texts</h2>
    {{#each licenses}}
    {{#if first_of_kind}}
    <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
    {{/if}}
    <section id="{{id}}-{{@index}}">
        <p>Used by:</p>
        <ul>
            {{#each used_by}}
            <li><a href="https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{#if crate.repository}} (<a href="{{crate.repository}}">repository</a>){{/if}}</li>
            {{/each}}
        </ul>
        {{#unless source_path}}
        <p>These crates do not ship a copy of this license with their own copyright notice, so the standard license text is shown below. The copyright holders are the authors of each crate; see the repository linked above.</p>
        {{/unless}}
        <pre class="license-text">{{text}}</pre>
    </section>
    {{/each}}
</body>
</html>
